  "rule": "Group the coloured cells into anti-diagonal segments (u=x+y, v-span of y-x). For every pair of segments on different lines whose v-spans overlap, paint 2 on each background cell strictly between their lines (by u) within the shared v-span. Fill a band even when another segment lies between the two lines. Segment cells keep their colour.",
